WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:02.127
♪♪

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:04.922
(Heavy breathing)

00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:05.839
Man:
The serpent has come.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:09.259
♪♪

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:10.594
Henry:
She was taken for her sins.

00:00:10.969 --> 00:00:12.512
No... it was an accident.

00:00:13.055 --> 00:00:14.640
Will:
God will look after her now.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:19.895
♪♪

00:00:19.895 --> 00:00:21.521
Cora:
A sea creature's been spotted.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:22.648
♪♪

00:00:22.648 --> 00:00:23.565
Naomi:
Is there something out there?

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:25.150
That’s what I’m here
to find out.

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:27.653
Cora:
I've done some research.

00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:28.862
Into a mythical beast?

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.239
Not mythical, real.

00:00:30.239 --> 00:00:31.740
♪♪

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.492
Will:
The serpent is... an invention.

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:36.411
Will:
A symptom of the times
we live in.

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:37.871
So you’re against progress?

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:38.622
(Chuckles)

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:40.332
(Seagulls squawk)

00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:44.211
I’d rather believe in a creature
people have actually seen than
an invisible God.

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:45.712
Is that blasphemy?

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:46.880
♪♪

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.966
You won’t get my husband to
judge you.

00:00:48.966 --> 00:00:50.092
Stella:
No matter how hard you try.

00:00:50.092 --> 00:00:51.218
(All laugh)

00:00:51.218 --> 00:00:53.762
♪♪

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:55.389
Stella:
Everyone’s a little on edge at
the moment.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:57.557
Lock your doors! Say your
prayers!

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:58.809
♪♪

00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:00.018
Will:
You’re trying to understand.

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:01.144
Trying to find the truth.

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:02.646
We must all follow our passions.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.189
I couldn’t agree more.

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:05.190
♪♪

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:06.191
Jo:
I’m scared.

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:06.984
It’s in us.

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:08.944
(Loud chattering)

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:09.569
Cora:
(Gasps)

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:10.445
Jo:
We brought it here.

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:11.321
Brought what here?

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:13.490
♪♪

00:01:13.490 --> 00:01:15.033
Martha:
You need to forget about Essex.

00:01:15.033 --> 00:01:16.535
I want you to come back.

00:01:16.535 --> 00:01:17.953
♪♪

00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:19.246
It sounds like you’re in love
with her.

00:01:19.246 --> 00:01:20.539
Everyone else is.

00:01:20.539 --> 00:01:22.582
♪♪

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:23.333
Cora:
I scared them.

00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:24.501
You didn’t start all this.

00:01:25.294 --> 00:01:28.046
We can’t control our inner
thoughts.

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:30.507
Luke:
But they can influence us.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:31.300
♪♪

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.260
It was woman that was tempted by
the serpent,

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:34.803
it was woman that ate the fruit.

00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:36.388
-Tasted Evil.
-Yeah yeah!

00:01:36.388 --> 00:01:37.347
♪♪

00:01:37.347 --> 00:01:38.473
Cora:
You let them accuse me.

00:01:38.473 --> 00:01:39.599
Cora:
You said nothing!

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:40.392
I’m their pastor.

00:01:40.392 --> 00:01:42.894
So you can’t be my friend and a
man of God?

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:45.480
Will:
I can’t think clearly when I’m
around you.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.357
I won’t be blamed for your
weakness.

00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:48.400
Love is not a weakness.

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:49.609
♪♪

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:52.654
Luke:
I think the Essex Serpent has
sunk its claws into you too.

00:01:52.654 --> 00:01:53.864
(Grunts)

00:01:53.864 --> 00:01:58.660
♪♪

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:00.412
Will:
Every one of us lives with doubt
and fear.

00:02:00.412 --> 00:02:01.330
♪♪

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:03.373
Will:
And now is the time for us
to come together.

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:04.624
Will:
Don’t be scared.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.418
Will:
It's when we're most lost...

00:02:06.418 --> 00:02:09.796
♪♪

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:12.132
Will:
That the source of light
is closest.

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:20.140
♪♪

